-- `map` over a lambda that reads a draw-bound random value. The explicit
-- recursive helper (`answers h qs = if isNull qs then [] else
-- (pickField (head qs) h) : answers h (tail qs)`) compiles and is exact;
-- the `map` spelling is refused. In the full experiment model the refusal
-- surfaced as the generate-backed prob-body guard instead ("main.prob: by
-- calling tells_gen"). Task map-lambda-over-shared-draw-refused.
data Pair = Pair l::Bool, r::Bool
pickField i f = if i == 0 then l f else r f
main qs = draw h = Pair (Uniform < 0.3) (Uniform < 0.6) in map (\q -> pickField q h) qs
